{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111636","id":2913002775,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6toOUX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111636","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111636.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111636.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111636","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111636/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111636/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111636/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0c22da1c4b31fd60186f8178a902a2db08e00427","number":111636,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Need Advice] Add @required annotation using PROPERTY_USAGE_REQUIRED ","user":{"login":"h-sigma","id":52352326,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzUyMzI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52352326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma","html_url":"https://github.com/h-sigma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-sigma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Edit: Renamed from @export_required to @required\r\n\r\nThis prototype adds an annotation `@required` that can be used as a second annotation for exported properties. It will issue a configuration warning if the property's value equals Variant::NIL. It does this by automatically adding the new enum value `PROPERTY_USAGE_REQUIRED` to the property usages, which is later checked in the Node's `update_configuration_warnings` function against every property to populate automatic warnings.\r\n\r\nDraft status reason:\r\n~~This PR adds a conditional to the GDScriptInstance::set hotpath. This is required to issue `update_configuration_warnings` when a required property's value changes. Sure, it is covered by a #ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED and Engine.is_editor_hint so it'll have no impact in build, but I don't love how the fairly neat and clean function has this block added into it, which is irrelevant to the rest of the function code.~~ Removed. Now configuration warnings are for @required are only updated on scene save. I mainly need advice on four things:\r\n1. Is there some place else where I can setup this kind of functionality instead? I was looking at the `editor_inspector`, since it already has a bunch of code related to property value changes. Of course, this would limit the configuration warning changes to only the changes made by the inspector.\r\n2. ~~The `PropertyUsageHint` enum feels a bit sacred. Is it fine to add another value to it?~~ Looks like modern systems should support up-to 64 properties in this enum and we have 29.\r\n3. Annotations are clearly a feature that should only be added-to or changed after a lot of deliberation. Is there even a chance of this PR getting merged?\r\n4. Does anyone see the point of comparing it to falsey values of other types? Right now, this is only effective for property types inheriting `Object` as it attempts to check the property value against Variant::NIL.  Assuming what's \"empty\" on non-reference types feels like one step too far into the land of PHP/Js horrors.\r\n\r\nRelated Proposals:\r\n- [#11832](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11832)\r\n- [#8343](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8343)\r\n- [#9759](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9759) \r\n- [#550](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/550)\r\n- [162](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/162) (Loosely related, would help a little with people worried about null values)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/org